      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/1761-utrecht-gold-ducat/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/numismatics/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Numismatics catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">United Provinces of the Netherlands &middot; Utrecht Mint &middot; 1761</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Gold Ducat &mdash; 1761</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Dutch trade ducat &middot; NGC AU Details (Edge Filing)</p>\n      </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"utrecht-ducat-1761\"\n            aria-label=\"1761 Utrecht gold ducat in NGC holder, obverse with standing knight and reverse with inscribed tablet — enlarge\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in; background:#ffffff; border-radius:4px; padding:16px;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/1761-netherland-ducat-utrecht-640.webp 640w, /uploads/1761-netherland-ducat-utrecht.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 792px) 100vw, 712px\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/1761-netherland-ducat-utrecht.png\"\n                alt=\"1761 Utrecht gold ducat in NGC holder, obverse with standing knight and reverse with inscribed tablet\"\n                width=\"1536\"\n                height=\"1024\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Enlarge\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (left) and reverse (right) &mdash; Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n</div>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#332e22; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">The Dutch trade ducat is one of the longest-running coin designs in history: the same standing-knight motif has been struck since the late 16th century and, in modern collector form, is still issued today. This 1761 example was struck at the Utrecht provincial mint during the era of the Dutch Republic (United Provinces).</p>\n\n      <section id=\"ducado-1761\" style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;\">\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 0 40px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">United Provinces of the Netherlands</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Mint</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Utrecht</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year of minting</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1761</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1 ducat</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Composition</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Gold .986</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Gross weight</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">3.49 g</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fine gold content</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">0.111 troy oz AGW</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Diameter</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">&asymp; 21 mm</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog references</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">KM-7.4 &middot; Friedberg 285 &middot; Numista N# 323147</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Certification</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">NGC AU Details &mdash; Edge Filing (No. 4685927-012)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n          <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"1761 Utrecht gold ducat in NGC holder, obverse with standing knight and reverse with inscribed tablet\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"utrecht-ducat-1761\" hidden\n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/1761-netherland-ducat-utrecht.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/1761-netherland-ducat-utrecht.png\"\n                    alt=\"1761 Utrecht gold ducat in NGC holder, obverse with standing knight and reverse with inscribed tablet\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Obverse</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 14px;\">A knight stands facing right in studded armor and plumed helmet, sword resting on his right shoulder and, in his left hand, a bundle of seven arrows representing the seven united provinces. The shield of Utrecht serves as the mintmark. The date is split across the field (17 &ndash; 61).</p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Legend:</strong> <em>CONCORDIA &middot; RES &middot; PARV&AElig; &middot; CRESCUNT</em></p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Translation:</strong> &ldquo;Through concord, small things grow.&rdquo;</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Reverse</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 14px;\">A square tablet framed by an ornamental mantle carries the legend in five lines.</p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Legend:</strong> <em>MO: ORD: PROVIN: FOEDER: BELG: AD LEG: IMP:</em></p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Translation:</strong> &ldquo;Coin of the Federated Provinces of the Netherlands, in accordance with the law of the Empire.&rdquo;</p>\n        </section>\n\n      </section>\n\n      <blockquote style=\"max-width:760px; margin:56px auto 0; padding:28px 0 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:20px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 10px;\">The gold ducat was the Dutch Republic&rsquo;s great trade coin: it circulated from the Baltic to the East Indies as a trusted medium of international commerce thanks to its unwavering fineness and weight. Its reputation even reached Australia &mdash; under Governor Philip Gidley King&rsquo;s Proclamation of 1800, the ducat was assigned an official value of 9 shillings 6 pence to keep coinage within the New South Wales colony, making the type an Australian &ldquo;Proclamation coin&rdquo; as well.</p>\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33;\">&mdash; Historical context note</span>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <section style=\"max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">About the certification</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">NGC&rsquo;s <strong>AU Details &mdash; Edge Filing</strong> designation confirms the coin&rsquo;s authenticity and About Uncirculated wear, but withholds a numeric grade due to filing on the edge. This kind of damage is extremely common on gold ducats: for centuries, small amounts of gold were shaved from the edges of circulating coins. In a sense it is a historical fingerprint of real-world use, though it limits market value relative to straight-graded examples.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"max-width:760px; margin:32px auto 0; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n        <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n          <li>Krause&ndash;Mishler (KM-7.4) &middot; Friedberg 285</li>\n          <li>Numista &mdash; <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/pieces323147.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">N# 323147<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n          <li>NGC Cert Lookup &mdash; <a href=\"https://www.ngccoin.com/certlookup/4685927-012/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">4685927-012<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n</div>",
